===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# The study of the fate of the [[remains]] of organisms after they die, especially the study of [[fossilization]]. {{defdate|from 20th c.}}
#* '''2011''', {{w|Steven Pinker}}, ''The Better Angels of Our Nature'', Penguin 2012, p. 4:
#*: Some cases may have an innocent explanation based in '''taphonomy''', the processes by which bodies are preserved over long spans of time.

